odule__coi--a__menuLabel\">Delete chat</p></button></div></div></div><div data-hf-id=\"hf-luf0\" class=\"ChatCard-module__coi--a__content\"><div data-hf-id=\"hf-a4xm\" class=\"ChatCard-module__coi--a__topRow\"><button data-hf-id=\"hf-v2bb\" type=\"button\" class=\"ChatCard-module__coi--a__optionsButton\" data-pw=\"history-chat-options-trigger\" aria-label=\"Open chat options\" title=\"Options\" data-chat-options-trigger=\"true\"><svg data-hf-id=\"hf-dl3x\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ChatCard-module__coi--a__optionsIcon\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path data-hf-id=\"hf-fyip\" d=\"M10 6a2 2 0 110-4 2 2 0 010 4zM10 12a2 2 0 110-4 2 2 0 010 4zM10 18a2 2 0 110-4 2 2 0 010 4z\"></path></svg></button></div><div data-hf-id=\"hf-kk0k\" class=\"ChatCard-module__coi--a__textWrap\"><h1 data-hf-id=\"hf-4h1x\" class=\"ChatCard-module__coi--a__title\">Study timetable</h1><div data-hf-id=\"hf-zgne\" class=\"ChatCard-module__coi--a__snippet\">Making time for homework and short breaks.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-hf-id=\"hf-cuxk\" class=\"History-module__Y977EG__loadMoreSentinel\" data-pw=\"history-load-more-sentinel\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>","metrics":{"width":1608,"height":1080,"logicalWidth":235.8125,"logicalHeight":117.90625,"originX":804,"originY":68.53125},"answer":"<div data-hf-id=\"hf-bd0v\" class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseBubbleShell\"><div data-hf-id=\"hf-07jd\" class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseBody\"><div data-hf-id=\"hf-lzws\" class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseBodyText\"><p class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseMarkdownParagraph\" id=\"answer-p0\" data-layout-allow-occlusion=\"\">Of course! The water cycle is water’s journey around Earth. Here’s a simple explanation for your presentation:</p>\n<p class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseMarkdownParagraph\" id=\"answer-p1\" data-layout-allow-occlusion=\"\"><strong data-layout-allow-occlusion=\"\">Evaporation:</strong> The sun warms water in rivers, lakes and oceans, turning it into invisible water vapour.</p>\n<p class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseMarkdownParagraph\" id=\"answer-p2\" data-layout-allow-occlusion=\"\"><strong data-layout-allow-occlusion=\"\">Condensation:</strong> As the vapour cools, it forms tiny droplets that gather into clouds.</p>\n<p class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseMarkdownParagraph\" id=\"answer-p3\" data-layout-allow-occlusion=\"\"><strong data-layout-allow-occlusion=\"\">Precipitation:</strong> Water falls from clouds as rain or snow.</p>\n<p class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseMarkdownParagraph\" id=\"answer-p4\" data-layout-allow-occlusion=\"\"><strong data-layout-allow-occlusion=\"\">Collection:</strong> Water gathers in rivers, lakes and oceans, while some soaks into the ground. Then the journey begins again!</p>\n<p class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseMarkdownParagraph\" id=\"answer-p5\" data-layout-allow-occlusion=\"\">You can remember it as: up, clouds, down, and around!</p>\n<p class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseMarkdownParagraph\" id=\"answer-p6\"><a class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseBodyLink\" href=\"https://water.usgs.gov/edu/watercycle-kids-beg.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" data-layout-allow-occlusion=\"\">Source: USGS Water Science School</a></p></div><div data-hf-id=\"hf-3d9u\" class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseMeta\"><div data-hf-id=\"hf-pppu\" class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseActions\"><button data-hf-id=\"hf-ez2p\" type=\"button\" class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseActionButton ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__quoteActionButton\"><span data-hf-id=\"hf-efph\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"Icon-module__S17-Oa__icon Icon-module__S17-Oa__mask ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__copyButtonIcon\" style=\"--icon-mask-image: url(&quot;assets/ui-f5b9a486c0e1daa6.svg&quot;);\"></span><span data-hf-id=\"hf-vcvc\" data-layout-allow-occlusion=\"\">Quotes</span></button><button data-hf-id=\"hf-ia0f\" type=\"button\" class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseActionButton\"><span data-hf-id=\"hf-word\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"Icon-module__S17-Oa__icon Icon-module__S17-Oa__mask ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__copyButtonIcon\" style=\"--icon-mask-image: url(&quot;assets/ui-f5b9a486c0e1daa6.svg&quot;);\"></span><span data-hf-id=\"hf-gcpp\" data-layout-allow-occlusion=\"\">Sources</span></button><button data-hf-id=\"hf-42a5\" type=\"button\" class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseActionButton\" aria-label=\"Copy\"><span data-hf-id=\"hf-2lm2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"Icon-module__S17-Oa__icon Icon-module__S17-Oa__mask ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__copyButtonIcon\" style=\"--icon-mask-image: url(&quot;assets/ui-334330ec96059d79.svg&quot;);\"></span><span data-hf-id=\"hf-xqbs\" data-layout-allow-occlusion=\"\">Copy</span></button></div><time data-hf-id=\"hf-2smq\" class=\"ChatResponseBubble-module__WuSOoa__responseTime\" datetime=\"2026-10-10T16:00:00.500Z\" data-layout-allow-occlusion=\"\">10/10/2026 12:00 PM</time></div></div></div>"}